        "**Trade command:** `buy sbin 10`, `b sbin`, `sell infy 5 @ 1500`, `s tcs 2 at 3900.5` — **opens the order ticket** pre-filled (a price makes it a Limit order). It is greyed with the reason if you are not the owner, Zerodha is not connected or trading is OFF. It only opens the ticket; nothing is sent without the ticket’s own confirm.",
